{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33891","headline":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 九 · 皮日休","name":"临顿爲吴中偏胜之地陆鲁望居之不出郛郭旷若郊墅余每相访欵然惜去因成五言十首奉题屋壁 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起扶灵寿，翛然强到门。\n与杉除败叶，爲石整危根。\n薜蔓任遮壁，莲茎卧枕盆。\n明朝有忙事，召客斵桐孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}